# A dedicated Ollama model for Minerva: the chosen base model with fixed generation settings.
# Weights are shared with the base model (no extra disk). The system prompt is NOT set here: the app
# sends its own, versioned in services/api/src/minerva_api/agent/prompts.py.
# Create it with scripts/create-ollama-model.sh (it substitutes __BASE__).
FROM __BASE__

# Low temperature: tool arguments and short explanations, not creative writing.
PARAMETER temperature 0.2
PARAMETER top_p 0.9
# Room for the system prompt, the tool schemas, the history and the reply. The full set of tools is about
# 22k tokens (measured with the deployed model); the app sends a core set of about 6k and adds the groups
# a conversation needs, and it sends `num_ctx` with every request (MINERVA_LLM_NUM_CTX), which overrides
# this line. Keep the two equal. A window smaller than the prompt makes the host drop the start of it,
# including the conversation and most of the tool definitions.
PARAMETER num_ctx 32768
# Cap the length of one model call. Answers should be short; the interface shows results as cards.
PARAMETER num_predict 1200
